#: ../../source/reference/actor.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Actor probably is the most important class in the Thunder Engine. It "
"represents all objects on the scene like 3D meshes, light sources, "
"effects and many more. You should think about Actor as a key chain for "
"the various Components. You can add and remove any components you like at"
" any time except the Transform component. The Transform component must "
"persist constantly and you shoudn't remove it."
msgstr ""

